  "description": "Mr. Do-Yun Kim’s a pretty quiet, unassuming guy at the office with a big secret. He’s actually half vampire! But without full vamp status, he can’t drink blood and has to seek out some human essence to live. Drained and desperate, he finds a “special” companion, but everything goes wrong. Now he’s caught up in a one-sided office relationship, and most importantly, it’s not working!!! Will Do-Yun survive and keep his secret intact? \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)\n\n*Note: Includes 10 extra chapters.*",
